        720,
        1508,
        871
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "b. The definition of the term \"pre-hearing temporary restrictive housing\" set forth in subdivision a is modified to allow the use of pre-hearing temporary restrictive housing based on the risk of imminent serious physical injury to staff, the incarcerated person, other incarcerated persons or to the public.",
